    "sections": {
        "description": "Terrifico is a fast, lightweight and accessible theme for small business websites, blogs and shops. Style the whole site from the Customizer with live preview: a front page made of reorderable sections with a hero and five hero designs, a global color palette and typography, container and sidebar layouts, three header layouts with a sticky or transparent header, a top bar, header button and search, blog list and grid layouts with sortable post elements, breadcrumbs, up to four footer widget columns and a copyright bar, scroll to top and WooCommerce options. Google Fonts are served from your own site. Ready for the block editor, translation and right-to-left languages."
    },
